<title>INDIA: India foodgrains stocks at 20.36 mln tns in Dec.</title>
<headline>India foodgrains stocks at 20.36 mln tns in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foodgrains stocks on December 1 1996 stood at 20.36 million tonnes compared with 29.89 million tonnes a year earlier, the Civil Supplies Ministry said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The Civil Supplies Ministry said in its annual report that wheat stocks on December 1 1996 stood at 8.32 million tonnes, down from 14.65 million at the same time in 1995.</p>
<p>Rice stocks on December 1 1996 stood at 12.04 million tonnes compared with 15.24 million tonnes a year earlier, the report said.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
